{"4302910": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Rabbit vs Mole", "steam_appid": 4302910, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🐰🕳️ Rabbit vs Mole – Farm. Fight. Outsmart.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rabbit vs Mole</strong> is an asymmetric farming game where peaceful agriculture meets clever rivalry. Choose your role and experience two completely different ways to play - above ground or below it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎮 Two Roles, Two Playstyles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rabbit – The Farmer</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cultivate fields on the surface</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant seeds, water crops, and harvest carrots</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage limited resources and plan ahead</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend your farm from underground threats</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mole – The Saboteur</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig tunnels in a living underground world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create mounds that connect surface and tunnels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recover health below ground and strike strategically</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Disrupt the Rabbit’s farm from unexpected angles</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚔️ Tactical Combat &amp; Choices</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Direct player-versus-player encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental destruction as a weapon</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Limited inventory - every item matters</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌾 Full Farming Loop</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant, water, harvest, and store crops</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimize your farm layout and timing</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎯 Multiple Game Modes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Co-op and competitive play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story mode told across 7 in-game days</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carrot race, time attack, and sandbox modes</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🏆 Progress &amp; Replayability</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect Golden Carrots each day</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new days, modifiers, and statistics</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎮 Local Multiplayer</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Split-screen play on one device</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full gamepad support</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🐰🕳️ Rabbit vs Mole – Farm. Fight. Outsmart.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rabbit vs Mole</strong> is an asymmetric farming game where peaceful agriculture meets clever rivalry. Choose your role and experience two completely different ways to play - above ground or below it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎮 Two Roles, Two Playstyles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rabbit – The Farmer</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cultivate fields on the surface</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant seeds, water crops, and harvest carrots</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage limited resources and plan ahead</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend your farm from underground threats</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mole – The Saboteur</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig tunnels in a living underground world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create mounds that connect surface and tunnels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recover health below ground and strike strategically</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Disrupt the Rabbit’s farm from unexpected angles</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚔️ Tactical Combat &amp; Choices</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>